  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and saute for 1 minute.",
    "Add the sliced mushrooms and cook until they are tender.",
    "Add the amazake, soy sauce, and sesame oil, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the cooked rice noodles to the skillet and toss to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 1-2 minutes, until the noodles are well coated.",
    "Serve the noodles hot, garnished with toasted sesame seeds and chopped green onions."
